### Component 3: Atomic 5-Minute Slot Hold Lock Engine (Backend)

Prevent double-booking by enforcing database transaction level locks and 5-minute expiration timers.

#### [MODIFY] [`matchPayment.routes.js`](file:///c:/Users/91969/OneDrive/Desktop/Kiaan/sport-turfs/turf%20Backend/src/modules/bookings/matchPayment.routes.js) / [`matchPayment.service.js`](file:///c:/Users/91969/OneDrive/Desktop/Kiaan/sport-turfs/turf%20Backend/src/modules/bookings/matchPayment.service.js)
- Implement `SELECT ... FOR UPDATE` or atomic `INSERT INTO slot_holds (slot_id, user_id, expires_at) VALUES (?, ?, NOW() + INTERVAL 5 MINUTE)` query.
- If a slot is already held by another user and `expires_at > NOW()`, return HTTP 409 Conflict error (`"Slot is currently being locked by another user. Try again in 5 minutes"`).
- Automatically release expired holds in `MatchExpiryService`.

